#. Scene label
#. screens: end_screen.tscn
msgid ""
"You did it! I'm proud of you! I hope you had fun.\n"
"\n"
"However I am very sorry that this is such a boring and uninspired win "
"screen. You deserve better and you will get better - in the full release.\n"
"\n"
"In the meantime, enjoy trying some of the harder difficulties, go spend "
"those Beanz on some upgrades and try out some different builds.\n"
"\n"
"If you had fun during this demo be sure to give it a wishlist or follow on "
"Steam - there's so much more to come!"
msgstr ""
"Tu as réussi ! Je suis fier de toi ! J'espère que ça t'a plu.\n"
"\n"
"Par contre, je suis vraiment désolé que cet écran de victoire soit aussi "
"ennuyeux et sans inspiration. Tu mérites mieux, et tu auras mieux dans la "
"version complète.\n"
"\n"
"En attendant, amuse-toi à tenter les difficultés plus élevées, dépense tes "
"Beanz en améliorations et essaie d'autres builds.\n"
"\n"
"Si cette démo t'a plu, pense à l'ajouter à ta liste de souhaits ou à la "
"suivre sur Steam : il reste encore tellement de choses à venir !"

